 class Time { /* ... */ };
 class Date { /* ... */ };

 // helper functions:
 bool operator==(Date, Date);
 Date next_weekday(Date);
 // ...
}

Note

This is especially important for 
overloaded operators
.

Enforcement

Flag global functions taking argument types from a single namespace.

