The use of 
using namespace std;
 leaves the programmer open to a name clash with a name from the standard library
#include <cmath>
using namespace std;

int g(int x)
{
 int sqrt = 7;
 // ...
 return sqrt(x); // error
}
However, this is not particularly likely to lead to a resolution that is not an error and
people who use 
using namespace std
 are supposed to know about 
std
 and about this risk.

